1
00:00:01,001 --> 00:00:03,336
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:06,464
[tense music playing]

3
00:00:20,353 --> 00:00:21,646
[screaming]

4
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:23,773
[shattering sound]

5
00:00:27,402 --> 00:00:29,612
[Lily] <i>I know you bombed my properties!</i>

6
00:00:29,696 --> 00:00:31,740
<i>And you sabotaged my shipment.</i>

7
00:00:31,823 --> 00:00:34,951
<i>An eye for an eye, Red Dragon.</i>

8
00:00:35,035 --> 00:00:36,161
[Lily] <i>You know what you deserve?</i>

9
00:00:36,244 --> 00:00:39,873
<i>What you deserve is a slow death</i>
<i>that eats at your soul.</i>

10
00:00:39,956 --> 00:00:41,791
<i>You deserve to feel every ounce of pain!</i>

11
00:00:41,875 --> 00:00:43,543
-<i>You'll suffer so bad</i>
-[screams]

12
00:00:43,626 --> 00:00:46,796
<i>and so much that you'll long</i>
<i>for death instead!</i>

13
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:49,424
<i>Sir. We're just waiting for Diego.</i>

14
00:00:49,507 --> 00:00:51,342
[Pandoy] <i>Loring! Run, Loring!</i>

15
00:00:51,426 --> 00:00:52,260
[gunshot]

16
00:00:52,343 --> 00:00:53,136
[Loring] <i>Pandoy!</i>

17
00:00:53,970 --> 00:00:55,221
<i>Don't! No!</i>

18
00:00:55,305 --> 00:00:56,389
[gunshot]

19
00:00:57,807 --> 00:00:58,683
<i>You bastard!</i>

20
00:01:00,310 --> 00:01:01,352
[doctor] <i>I'm so sorry.</i>

21
00:01:01,436 --> 00:01:04,898
<i>We did everything we could,</i>
<i>but they'd both lost too much blood.</i>

22
00:01:05,398 --> 00:01:08,443
<i>They'll pay for this.</i>
<i>They'll pay for this!</i>

23
00:01:08,526 --> 00:01:09,527
[Arnaldo] <i>I haven't met you,</i>

24
00:01:09,611 --> 00:01:11,321
<i>but I can't stop myself</i>
<i>from thinking about you.</i>

25
00:01:11,404 --> 00:01:13,573
<i>I always see you in my dreams.</i>

26
00:01:13,656 --> 00:01:15,408
<i>Why does it feel like</i>
<i>I'm in love with you?</i>

27
00:01:15,492 --> 00:01:17,452
<i>Until the last drop of her blood spills,</i>

28
00:01:17,535 --> 00:01:18,495
<i>I'll plan her demise.</i>

29
00:01:18,578 --> 00:01:22,332
<i>I just need for you to execute</i>
<i>the perfect crime.</i>

30
00:01:22,415 --> 00:01:25,293
<i>I want you to kill Lily Cruz.</i>

31
00:01:25,376 --> 00:01:28,379
<i>I'm scared! If you could</i>
<i>only see yourself right now.</i>

32
00:01:28,463 --> 00:01:30,215
[Lily] <i>It's like you're ready to kill!</i>

33
00:01:30,298 --> 00:01:32,008
<i>I won't let you turn into</i>
<i>a criminal, Diego!</i>

34
00:01:32,091 --> 00:01:34,803
[Diego] <i>But there's no place</i>
<i>for justice here in Ardiente!</i>

35
00:01:34,886 --> 00:01:35,887
<i>I will kill them.</i>

36
00:01:35,970 --> 00:01:38,431
<i>-Diego, don't! Diego!</i>
-[Jepoy]<i> Diego!</i>

37
00:01:39,015 --> 00:01:40,141
[door slams]

38
00:01:42,977 --> 00:01:45,605
[dramatic music playing]

39
00:01:49,067 --> 00:01:51,236
[panting]

40
00:02:00,245 --> 00:02:01,913
[shouting in agony]

41
00:02:06,042 --> 00:02:09,671
[shouting] No! No!

42
00:02:10,338 --> 00:02:12,799
[dramatic music playing]

43
00:02:20,598 --> 00:02:22,433
[shouting] No!

44
00:02:49,335 --> 00:02:51,880
[ominous music playing]

45
00:03:02,557 --> 00:03:06,269
[Diego] <i>I swear to you</i>
<i>that I'll make them all pay</i>

46
00:03:06,352 --> 00:03:07,604
<i>for what they did to you.</i>

47
00:03:08,897 --> 00:03:10,273
<i>All the abuse…</i>

48
00:03:11,941 --> 00:03:13,610
<i>All the lies and treachery…</i>

49
00:03:17,030 --> 00:03:19,741
<i>and all the evil I ignored</i>

50
00:03:19,824 --> 00:03:22,243
<i>because I believed in hope and change…</i>

51
00:03:24,037 --> 00:03:25,747
[slow tense music playing]

52
00:03:28,875 --> 00:03:30,960
<i>The old Diego Torillo is gone.</i>

53
00:03:32,503 --> 00:03:33,755
<i>All that's left</i>

54
00:03:34,797 --> 00:03:38,134
<i>is a man thirsty</i>
<i>for the blood of his enemies!</i>

55
00:03:57,528 --> 00:04:01,449
[somber music playing]

56
00:04:14,295 --> 00:04:15,338
Come on, Lily.

57
00:04:34,023 --> 00:04:35,024
No, Mom.

58
00:04:37,443 --> 00:04:39,153
We should leave Diego alone for now.

59
00:04:45,535 --> 00:04:46,995
[somber music playing]

60
00:04:58,006 --> 00:04:59,465
If they're already buried,

61
00:04:59,549 --> 00:05:02,135
then just let their corpses rot already.

62
00:05:03,052 --> 00:05:05,096
You know the problem with those lowlifes?

63
00:05:06,347 --> 00:05:09,392
They're too emotional.
Just a bunch of softies!

64
00:05:10,893 --> 00:05:13,730
So, Governor, have I redeemed myself?

65
00:05:14,856 --> 00:05:16,149
[Julio chuckles]

66
00:05:16,232 --> 00:05:17,317
[sinister music playing]

67
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:18,609
Talk to me again

68
00:05:18,693 --> 00:05:22,655
when I'm seated
behind my desk in the capitol.

69
00:05:24,157 --> 00:05:28,494
Speaking of… I want to see Judge Lustre.

70
00:05:29,620 --> 00:05:32,707
I want to make sure
that nothing will prevent

71
00:05:32,790 --> 00:05:35,918
the dismissal
of Camia Cruz's case against me.

72
00:05:36,210 --> 00:05:37,045
Yes, Governor.

73
00:05:42,258 --> 00:05:44,719
Emilia, would you please stop chitchatting

74
00:05:44,802 --> 00:05:46,220
with whoever that is?

75
00:05:47,013 --> 00:05:49,223
Come here and help me celebrate

76
00:05:49,932 --> 00:05:54,979
because I just one-upped Lily Cruz's camp.

77
00:05:55,938 --> 00:05:57,023
Hmm…

78
00:05:57,356 --> 00:05:59,108
I don't know if I should
tell you this, Papa,

79
00:05:59,192 --> 00:06:02,570
because we're not allies anymore.

80
00:06:02,653 --> 00:06:05,490
And Mama is not doing so good

81
00:06:06,324 --> 00:06:09,368
because Lily Cruz has found out
that she's Red Dragon.

82
00:06:10,828 --> 00:06:11,746
You…

83
00:06:13,664 --> 00:06:14,957
Well, whatever!

84
00:06:16,501 --> 00:06:19,087
Look at how things are turning out.

85
00:06:20,129 --> 00:06:26,010
Meanwhile, I'll be returning
to my position!

86
00:06:27,136 --> 00:06:30,389
Do you really think you can
get back your position?

87
00:06:30,473 --> 00:06:31,724
No, no, no.

88
00:06:31,808 --> 00:06:35,394
Because Diego Torillo will make sure
that you go to prison.

89
00:06:36,354 --> 00:06:38,815
Hey! Listen!

90
00:06:39,482 --> 00:06:40,900
Go to the garden.

91
00:06:41,484 --> 00:06:43,528
You know those flowers
that scatter on the grass?

92
00:06:44,362 --> 00:06:47,198
The ones called wildflowers?

93
00:06:48,199 --> 00:06:50,535
You see, even if no one tends to them,

94
00:06:51,202 --> 00:06:52,495
they can survive on their own.

95
00:06:53,204 --> 00:06:54,372
They reproduce.

96
00:06:55,081 --> 00:06:56,666
But there are some plants

97
00:06:56,749 --> 00:07:00,753
that even when stepped on or crushed

98
00:07:00,837 --> 00:07:02,088
or even poisoned,

99
00:07:02,922 --> 00:07:04,674
won't just die.

100
00:07:04,757 --> 00:07:07,426
They even cause harm to other plants.

101
00:07:07,510 --> 00:07:08,594
You know what they're called?

102
00:07:10,596 --> 00:07:12,598
They're called weeds.

103
00:07:13,474 --> 00:07:17,311
Now, you and I… we're like that.

104
00:07:18,312 --> 00:07:22,108
We're like weeds that
are difficult to get rid of.

105
00:07:22,733 --> 00:07:23,734
So, you see,

106
00:07:24,861 --> 00:07:27,447
there is such a thing as forever

107
00:07:27,530 --> 00:07:30,074
or everlasting.

108
00:07:31,451 --> 00:07:32,493
You're a funeral wreath.

109
00:07:37,957 --> 00:07:41,377
How did I deserve such a daughter?

110
00:07:44,130 --> 00:07:44,964
[exhales sharply]

111
00:07:48,926 --> 00:07:50,636
[crickets chirping]

112
00:07:51,471 --> 00:07:52,305
Jepoy.

113
00:07:54,015 --> 00:07:55,641
[soft music playing]

114
00:08:03,274 --> 00:08:06,527
Diego's bottled up so much pain and rage

115
00:08:07,528 --> 00:08:09,947
caused by the Ardientes' crimes
against him.

116
00:08:12,617 --> 00:08:14,368
His anger will consume him, Lily.

117
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:18,873
Just like how our anger
towards Arnaldo changed us

118
00:08:20,374 --> 00:08:21,959
after he killed Nanny Carlotta.

119
00:08:24,212 --> 00:08:26,881
I will never forget
how Diego tried to stop me

120
00:08:28,549 --> 00:08:30,426
then when I couldn't control my anger.

121
00:08:31,219 --> 00:08:35,097
<i>We only use guns, to protect ourselves.</i>

122
00:08:35,181 --> 00:08:36,224
<i>I can't believe you!</i>

123
00:08:36,307 --> 00:08:37,558
[Anna] <i>Jepoy!</i>

124
00:08:37,642 --> 00:08:39,644
<i>You think you're an angel</i>

125
00:08:39,727 --> 00:08:41,896
<i>but this town isn't a</i>
<i>place for angels, Diego!</i>

126
00:08:41,979 --> 00:08:44,273
<i>Fine, go and kill. Let's all kill!</i>

127
00:08:44,357 --> 00:08:46,234
<i>How will that make us</i>
<i>any different from them?!</i>

128
00:08:47,693 --> 00:08:49,195
He really tried to stop me,

129
00:08:49,278 --> 00:08:50,780
to the point that we almost fought.

130
00:08:53,491 --> 00:08:55,701
As much as I want to support him,

131
00:08:57,036 --> 00:08:59,038
I'm honestly worried for him now, Lily.

132
00:08:59,956 --> 00:09:00,873
Because he's changed.

133
00:09:01,457 --> 00:09:02,250
[sighs]

134
00:09:02,333 --> 00:09:05,253
No. Diego can't… Diego won't kill anyone.

135
00:09:05,962 --> 00:09:07,338
We shouldn't be scared.

136
00:09:08,339 --> 00:09:09,966
Diego wouldn't do such a thing.

137
00:09:11,342 --> 00:09:12,843
He will come to his senses.

138
00:09:13,970 --> 00:09:21,936
He'll realize that violence
isn't necessary to seek revenge.

139
00:09:23,646 --> 00:09:25,064
We don't have to kill people…

140
00:09:27,233 --> 00:09:28,693
to find justice.

141
00:09:29,860 --> 00:09:32,321
[soft music continues playing]

142
00:09:33,948 --> 00:09:35,157
Diego will realize that.

143
00:09:36,534 --> 00:09:37,618
I believe in him.

144
00:09:38,494 --> 00:09:40,621
I know Diego.
I know he'll do what's right.

145
00:09:50,047 --> 00:09:52,592
[foreboding music playing]

146
00:10:10,276 --> 00:10:11,944
[tense music playing]

147
00:10:29,712 --> 00:10:31,756
[breathing heavily]

148
00:11:03,162 --> 00:11:05,247
[Arnaldo] <i>I need to see you again, Lily.</i>

149
00:11:12,421 --> 00:11:14,006
[soft piano music playing]

150
00:11:16,425 --> 00:11:17,551
[Lily] <i>No. Diego can't…</i>

151
00:11:17,635 --> 00:11:20,638
<i>Diego won't kill anyone. I believe in him.</i>

152
00:11:20,721 --> 00:11:22,681
<i>I know Diego.</i>
<i>I know he'll do what's right.</i>

153
00:11:24,934 --> 00:11:27,895
[Diego] <i>There's no place</i>
<i>for justice in Ardiente!</i>

154
00:11:27,978 --> 00:11:30,815
<i>So, let's stop fooling ourselves.</i>
<i>I will kill them.</i>

155
00:11:30,898 --> 00:11:32,942
<i>Diego, don't. Please, listen to me.</i>

156
00:11:33,025 --> 00:11:34,151
<i>I will kill them!</i>

157
00:11:34,235 --> 00:11:35,528
<i>-Diego!</i>
-[Jepoy] <i>Diego!</i>

158
00:11:50,376 --> 00:11:52,878
[somber music playing]

159
00:11:58,968 --> 00:12:00,136
[Loring] <i>What's all that?</i>

160
00:12:00,219 --> 00:12:01,470
[Lily] <i>Since it's Mr. Pandoy's birthday…</i>

161
00:12:01,554 --> 00:12:02,304
<i>Hold on. Wait.</i>

162
00:12:02,388 --> 00:12:04,557
-[Pandoy] <i>Are all those for me?</i>
-[Lily] <i>Yes. And these too.</i>

163
00:12:04,640 --> 00:12:05,599
<i>-Wow!</i>
<i>-This one's from my mom.</i>

164
00:12:05,683 --> 00:12:06,600
<i>This is a lot.</i>

165
00:12:06,684 --> 00:12:09,103
<i>-These are from Anna and Jepoy.</i>
<i>-I'm very grateful. Thank you.</i>

166
00:12:09,186 --> 00:12:10,146
[Loring] <i>Wow! Look at this!</i>

167
00:12:12,481 --> 00:12:14,817
[somber music continues playing]

168
00:12:41,719 --> 00:12:43,888
<i>I'll get you some take-out later.</i>

169
00:12:43,971 --> 00:12:45,097
<i>It'll be our secret.</i>

170
00:12:45,848 --> 00:12:47,391
<i>Thanks, Nanny.</i>

171
00:12:47,475 --> 00:12:48,851
[Diego] <i>Grandpa, it hurts!</i>

172
00:12:48,934 --> 00:12:49,977
[Julio] <i>Feel the pain!</i>

173
00:12:50,853 --> 00:12:53,564
[Loring] <i>It's okay.</i>
<i>I'll make it all better, Diego.</i>

174
00:12:54,356 --> 00:12:56,942
<i>-It hurts!</i>
<i>-I'm here.</i>

175
00:12:58,277 --> 00:12:59,862
[young Diego crying]

176
00:12:59,945 --> 00:13:03,949
[Loring] <i>Wait, who was the girl</i>
<i>you gave the flowers to?</i>

177
00:13:04,033 --> 00:13:06,076
-[Pandoy] <i>You're just jealous.</i>
-<i>Jealous?</i>

178
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:09,872
<i>-Someone's jealous.</i>
<i>-No, I'm not!</i>

179
00:13:09,955 --> 00:13:16,795
<i>No one's as handsome as my dearest Diego.</i>

180
00:13:16,879 --> 00:13:19,131
<i>Hey, hey, hey. What about me?</i>

181
00:13:19,215 --> 00:13:20,925
[Loring] <i>You? Wow.</i>

182
00:13:21,008 --> 00:13:22,343
[Diego] <i>Now who's jealous?</i>

183
00:13:25,179 --> 00:13:31,852
[dramatic music playing]

184
00:13:36,732 --> 00:13:40,277
<i>If you still respect me</i>
<i>as your second father,</i>

185
00:13:40,361 --> 00:13:43,864
<i>you won't pick a fight with the Ardientes!</i>

186
00:13:43,948 --> 00:13:48,994
<i>I won't let them kill you too!</i>

187
00:13:49,703 --> 00:13:52,498
<i>I'm sorry if… if I made you worry.</i>

188
00:13:52,831 --> 00:13:56,460
<i>Forget that, Diego.</i>
<i>What's important is you're home.</i>

189
00:14:10,516 --> 00:14:12,518
[sobbing]

190
00:14:19,233 --> 00:14:20,359
[phone ringing]

191
00:14:24,321 --> 00:14:25,281
[cancels call]

192
00:14:39,336 --> 00:14:41,338
[voice prompt] <i>The</i>
<i>subscriber cannot be reached.</i>

193
00:14:41,422 --> 00:14:43,173
<i>Please try again later.</i>

194
00:14:45,843 --> 00:14:47,678
[tense music playing]

195
00:14:56,395 --> 00:14:57,313
Lily.

196
00:14:58,689 --> 00:15:00,649
Mom, I need to go to Diego.

197
00:15:17,625 --> 00:15:19,293
[ominous music playing]

198
00:15:31,931 --> 00:15:32,890
Diego…

199
00:15:39,396 --> 00:15:40,940
I know you want to be alone right now.

200
00:15:45,569 --> 00:15:47,613
But I'm sorry, I can't give you that.

201
00:15:50,783 --> 00:15:52,076
I don't want to leave you.

202
00:15:52,451 --> 00:15:53,619
That's why I'm here.

203
00:15:57,915 --> 00:15:59,583
What are you going to do with that gun?

204
00:16:06,131 --> 00:16:07,841
Diego, we already talked about this.

205
00:16:09,385 --> 00:16:10,970
We aren't murderers.

206
00:16:11,971 --> 00:16:13,180
This isn't the way.

207
00:16:14,807 --> 00:16:16,266
This isn't right, Diego.

208
00:16:17,893 --> 00:16:19,520
[tense music playing]

209
00:16:34,827 --> 00:16:36,829
Diego, I want to protect you…

210
00:16:38,998 --> 00:16:41,583
because I understand the pain
you're going through right now.

211
00:16:45,963 --> 00:16:48,465
And until now, I still feel the same pain.

212
00:16:50,092 --> 00:16:52,594
But I will never let that…

213
00:16:54,972 --> 00:16:56,306
turn me into a murderer.

214
00:16:57,975 --> 00:16:59,977
I'm here to protect you.

215
00:17:00,561 --> 00:17:01,937
I'm here to save you.

216
00:17:04,064 --> 00:17:05,774
Diego, please listen to me.

217
00:17:07,568 --> 00:17:09,069
Diego, please listen.

218
00:17:10,487 --> 00:17:17,077
Don't let your hatred cloud
your principles.

219
00:17:18,954 --> 00:17:19,955
Diego, please.

220
00:17:23,333 --> 00:17:24,960
Killing other people…

221
00:17:26,587 --> 00:17:33,093
won't give you the justice you want.

222
00:17:40,309 --> 00:17:42,019
[somber music playing]

223
00:17:47,983 --> 00:17:49,943
Diego, please.

224
00:17:51,445 --> 00:17:53,489
[Diego] <i>I'm not the same</i>
<i>Diego Torillo you knew.</i>

225
00:17:54,656 --> 00:17:56,617
<i>And I'll never be that man again.</i>

226
00:17:58,368 --> 00:18:00,871
<i>Now, I've realized</i>
<i>that the world is a cruel place,</i>

227
00:18:01,163 --> 00:18:02,956
<i>and principles have no place in it.</i>

228
00:18:05,793 --> 00:18:07,503
<i>That's why I will kill Sanggano.</i>

229
00:18:08,837 --> 00:18:10,005
[Lily] Diego, wait.

230
00:18:14,676 --> 00:18:16,345
[Diego] <i>And if you're going to stop me,</i>

231
00:18:17,971 --> 00:18:19,264
<i>then we best go our separate ways.</i>

232
00:18:20,224 --> 00:18:21,558
Forgive me.

233
00:18:24,103 --> 00:18:25,813
[tense music playing]

234
00:18:46,208 --> 00:18:49,753
Lily, I'm afraid of what Diego might do.

235
00:18:58,011 --> 00:18:59,680
He's consumed by anger, Mom.

236
00:19:01,265 --> 00:19:03,100
His eyes were full of rage.

237
00:19:05,936 --> 00:19:07,855
I felt that way too

238
00:19:10,941 --> 00:19:12,568
when they killed Dad.

239
00:19:13,944 --> 00:19:16,363
When I thought I lost you,

240
00:19:16,822 --> 00:19:18,282
[soft music playing]

241
00:19:18,532 --> 00:19:20,617
and when they killed Nanny Carlotta.

242
00:19:24,204 --> 00:19:28,333
That was exactly how I felt.

243
00:19:31,545 --> 00:19:33,213
That's why, deep inside,

244
00:19:34,214 --> 00:19:37,176
I can feel every ounce of anger and pain…

245
00:19:39,178 --> 00:19:41,180
that now resides in Diego's heart.

246
00:19:43,891 --> 00:19:47,060
I feel his rage blinding him.

247
00:19:49,146 --> 00:19:51,315
His desire to seek revenge,

248
00:19:53,400 --> 00:19:56,111
and his thirst for justice…

249
00:19:57,279 --> 00:20:02,284
All those emotions… were
exactly what I felt once before.

250
00:20:04,244 --> 00:20:05,162
[sighs]

251
00:20:06,955 --> 00:20:11,293
But what if Diego
pushes through with his plan?

252
00:20:18,967 --> 00:20:21,637
No, Mom. I don't want to think about it.

253
00:20:21,720 --> 00:20:22,721
[crying]

254
00:20:26,725 --> 00:20:27,726
[Ivy sighs]

255
00:20:29,895 --> 00:20:33,273
The man I saw earlier
wasn't the Diego I knew.

256
00:20:35,108 --> 00:20:36,485
He was fuming.

257
00:20:37,569 --> 00:20:39,404
And it scares me, Mom.

258
00:20:45,994 --> 00:20:47,788
But even though…

259
00:20:53,252 --> 00:20:54,461
Though he's pushing me away,

260
00:20:54,544 --> 00:20:56,255
I'll continue to be there for him.

261
00:21:00,842 --> 00:21:02,511
[somber music playing]

262
00:21:23,865 --> 00:21:28,412
Those pests who were
protecting Diego are now dead.

263
00:21:29,746 --> 00:21:35,419
And Lily Cruz now knows that
Helena Montoya is Red Dragon.

264
00:21:37,379 --> 00:21:42,759
So, how can this day get even better?

265
00:21:43,760 --> 00:21:46,888
[lawyer] Well, all the witnesses
from Camia Cruz's camp

266
00:21:46,972 --> 00:21:48,056
have backed out.

267
00:21:49,224 --> 00:21:50,851
And you know what that means.

268
00:21:51,601 --> 00:21:54,980
The court will find her case
weak without a witness.

269
00:21:55,647 --> 00:21:57,691
They'll have a hard time
calling a hearing.

270
00:21:58,233 --> 00:21:59,693
I'm not the presiding judge,

271
00:21:59,776 --> 00:22:02,821
but I have a lot of connections, Julio.

272
00:22:03,113 --> 00:22:04,531
[chuckling]

273
00:22:04,614 --> 00:22:07,951
And before we know it,
the case will be dissolved.

274
00:22:10,996 --> 00:22:13,540
Victory won't be Julio Ardiente's.

275
00:22:14,124 --> 00:22:18,712
Yes, we have a lot on our plate,
but if he thinks

276
00:22:19,379 --> 00:22:25,052
I'll stop going after him,
well, he's dead wrong.

277
00:22:26,011 --> 00:22:29,973
[lawyer] What if they find new witnesses?

278
00:22:30,640 --> 00:22:32,142
Will you still honor them, Judge?

279
00:22:32,559 --> 00:22:36,897
I know Camia and Attorney
Fisher. They won't give up.

280
00:22:37,564 --> 00:22:39,816
I'm going to set a meeting
with Judge Lustre.

281
00:22:39,900 --> 00:22:42,277
The judge getting into bed
with Julio Ardiente.

282
00:22:42,360 --> 00:22:45,489
And if I need to bargain with him

283
00:22:45,572 --> 00:22:47,991
just to prevent Julio
from assuming power, I'll do it.

284
00:22:48,784 --> 00:22:49,743
Wait, attorney.

285
00:22:51,453 --> 00:22:52,788
We're in the right.

286
00:22:53,497 --> 00:22:55,040
We don't need to play their game.

287
00:22:55,999 --> 00:23:00,420
Attorney, come on.
Diego's foster parents are dead.

288
00:23:01,505 --> 00:23:06,051
Lily Cruz is busy
chasing after Red Dragon.

289
00:23:07,344 --> 00:23:12,224
You know, they're like bees
whose hive just fell off a tree.

290
00:23:12,307 --> 00:23:13,183
They're rattled.

291
00:23:14,351 --> 00:23:15,811
While all of this is happening,

292
00:23:16,812 --> 00:23:22,943
I will slowly sneak into the capitol

293
00:23:23,026 --> 00:23:26,363
and claim the position
that is rightfully mine.

294
00:23:26,947 --> 00:23:28,782
[tense music playing]

295
00:23:29,658 --> 00:23:32,119
Governor of Ardiente.

296
00:23:34,579 --> 00:23:36,248
The king is back!

297
00:23:36,540 --> 00:23:38,416
-I'll drink to that.
-Cheers!

298
00:23:38,500 --> 00:23:39,709
<i>Cheers, Governor!</i>

299
00:23:39,793 --> 00:23:41,545
[men laughing]

300
00:23:41,628 --> 00:23:43,964
This truly is a lovely day.

301
00:23:45,715 --> 00:23:48,718
We have to secure an advantage
before Julio's camp does.

302
00:23:49,803 --> 00:23:51,721
And the evidence against Red Dragon?

303
00:23:51,805 --> 00:23:53,890
All evidences are admissible in court.

304
00:23:54,474 --> 00:23:55,600
We need a…

305
00:23:55,809 --> 00:23:57,269
A credible witness.

306
00:23:58,770 --> 00:24:00,355
[suspenseful music playing]

307
00:24:00,939 --> 00:24:02,649
I know someone.

308
00:24:03,483 --> 00:24:05,944
And I know where to find her.

309
00:24:07,195 --> 00:24:10,031
[suspenseful music playing]

310
00:24:27,632 --> 00:24:29,176
[tense music playing]

311
00:24:38,351 --> 00:24:40,604
[Lily] <i>You should be here, Diego,</i>

312
00:24:41,980 --> 00:24:44,900
<i>looking for justice that we both want.</i>

313
00:24:56,161 --> 00:24:57,204
[doorbell rings]

314
00:25:06,254 --> 00:25:07,297
Lily?

315
00:25:09,382 --> 00:25:10,967
We need to talk.

316
00:25:11,051 --> 00:25:13,553
[suspenseful music playing]

317
00:25:19,100 --> 00:25:21,645
[Mercedes] There has been a lot
of security breach lately.

318
00:25:22,812 --> 00:25:26,858
We need to tighten security
from the inside out.

319
00:25:27,817 --> 00:25:29,027
Am I clear on that?

320
00:25:29,569 --> 00:25:30,570
-Yes, ma'am.
-Yes, ma'am.

321
00:25:31,821 --> 00:25:32,822
You may go.

322
00:25:46,253 --> 00:25:49,798
Mercedes, this came in for you.

323
00:26:01,434 --> 00:26:03,061
[slow tense music playing]

324
00:26:05,814 --> 00:26:07,190
From Red Dragon?

325
00:26:14,614 --> 00:26:15,657
You may go.

326
00:26:23,707 --> 00:26:24,499
[door closes]

327
00:26:43,518 --> 00:26:47,105
[Mercedes] <i>Let your plans be</i>
<i>dark and impenetrable as night.</i>

328
00:26:48,148 --> 00:26:51,109
<i>And when you move,</i>
<i>fall like a thunderbolt.</i>

329
00:27:03,330 --> 00:27:05,999
<i>Burn this after reading.</i>

330
00:27:06,875 --> 00:27:08,960
<i>Follow the instructions until the end.</i>

331
00:27:09,878 --> 00:27:12,881
<i>Destroy all the important files</i>

332
00:27:12,964 --> 00:27:16,634
<i>proving that Helena Montoya is Red Dragon.</i>

333
00:27:17,761 --> 00:27:21,765
<i>Do this in the dead of night.</i>
<i>Nobody should find out.</i>

334
00:27:22,474 --> 00:27:25,477
<i>Be unpredictable as lightning.</i>

335
00:27:25,560 --> 00:27:27,187
[ominous music playing]

336
00:27:37,614 --> 00:27:41,368
I need you to give a statement
against Red Dragon.

337
00:27:43,495 --> 00:27:44,662
But, Lily…

338
00:27:50,668 --> 00:27:52,712
This can only go two ways, Myla.

339
00:27:53,296 --> 00:27:59,427
Either we fight
and you end up losing again,

340
00:28:01,012 --> 00:28:04,265
or you tell me everything you know.

341
00:28:05,225 --> 00:28:08,269
Nothing more, nothing less.

342
00:28:09,145 --> 00:28:10,730
[tense music playing]

343
00:28:43,179 --> 00:28:45,640
[Myla] <i>Telling on Mercedes</i>
<i>is one thing, Lily.</i>

344
00:28:47,308 --> 00:28:50,854
But telling on Red Dragon is another.

345
00:28:51,938 --> 00:28:54,566
I know she'll get back at me if I do that.

346
00:28:56,609 --> 00:28:58,111
Don't you know what she's capable of?

347
00:28:59,487 --> 00:29:02,073
She can take everything away from us.

348
00:29:02,157 --> 00:29:06,286
If I don't get to her first. I assure you,

349
00:29:06,369 --> 00:29:09,456
nothing bad will happen to you
as long as you're with me.

350
00:29:10,457 --> 00:29:14,127
That said, tell me everything you know

351
00:29:14,502 --> 00:29:19,841
that could serve as evidence
against Red Dragon.

352
00:29:20,508 --> 00:29:22,177
[tense music playing]

353
00:29:29,809 --> 00:29:33,980
Take this blue book to Romulo.
I told him to keep this safe.

354
00:29:36,691 --> 00:29:39,736
We'll need this for
Red Dragon's transactions.

355
00:29:40,111 --> 00:29:45,700
Tell Romulo to keep it away
from anyone we don't trust.

356
00:29:46,451 --> 00:29:47,577
Understood?

357
00:30:03,009 --> 00:30:03,802
All right.

358
00:30:04,844 --> 00:30:06,554
I'll stand as your witness against her.

359
00:30:08,181 --> 00:30:10,517
But I don't have any documents or evidence

360
00:30:10,600 --> 00:30:11,643
against Red Dragon.

361
00:30:13,937 --> 00:30:15,522
Only Mercedes and Romulo have those.

362
00:30:16,648 --> 00:30:17,982
You better hurry, Lily.

363
00:30:18,733 --> 00:30:21,986
Now that Red Dragon knows
you know her identity,

364
00:30:23,613 --> 00:30:27,325
she could already be destroying
any possible evidence

365
00:30:27,408 --> 00:30:29,202
that might reveal her secrets.

366
00:30:33,122 --> 00:30:36,292
[suspenseful music playing]

367
00:30:43,299 --> 00:30:44,801
-Thanks, boss.
-Cheers.

368
00:30:45,593 --> 00:30:46,594
[Jose] I'm telling you.

369
00:30:47,637 --> 00:30:49,889
There's no way Julio Ardiente
will have me killed.

370
00:30:50,640 --> 00:30:51,975
[chuckles]

371
00:30:52,976 --> 00:30:55,812
Never! If it weren't for me,

372
00:30:56,229 --> 00:30:59,190
that old man would've
been found in a rubbish dump.

373
00:31:00,233 --> 00:31:01,693
I'm the only man he trusts now.

374
00:31:02,151 --> 00:31:04,737
He can't even rely
on his grandson anymore.

375
00:31:05,655 --> 00:31:08,491
Boss, you should've killed Diego Torillo.

376
00:31:08,700 --> 00:31:11,160
Julio wouldn't have slammed you,
and just given you a bonus--

377
00:31:11,244 --> 00:31:11,995
Shut up!

378
00:31:15,623 --> 00:31:17,625
It wasn't easy taking him down,

379
00:31:18,960 --> 00:31:20,962
unlike those old geezers. But that's fine.

380
00:31:21,921 --> 00:31:23,590
Because now, the idiot's crying a river.

381
00:31:23,673 --> 00:31:25,341
[tense music playing]

382
00:31:25,967 --> 00:31:30,555
But that Torillo better be careful.

383
00:31:31,180 --> 00:31:36,144
One wrong move and he'll meet
his aunt and uncle in purgatory.

384
00:31:39,647 --> 00:31:40,773
Mark my words!

385
00:31:40,857 --> 00:31:42,233
[goon] Cheers to that, boss.

386
00:31:43,026 --> 00:31:44,736
[tense music playing]

387
00:31:48,531 --> 00:31:50,116
[indistinct chatter]

388
00:31:51,743 --> 00:31:53,244
Let's finish this up.

389
00:31:59,083 --> 00:31:59,918
Hi.

390
00:32:00,001 --> 00:32:02,003
Madam Emilia, you can't go any further.

391
00:32:02,086 --> 00:32:03,004
What the hell?

392
00:32:03,087 --> 00:32:04,797
Mercedes strictly prohibited anyone

393
00:32:04,881 --> 00:32:08,092
from entering the chamber.
She'll see you when she's done.

394
00:32:08,843 --> 00:32:11,262
First, it's Mama. Now, it's Mercedes.

395
00:32:11,346 --> 00:32:13,973
What can she be busy
with that she can't see me?

396
00:32:17,352 --> 00:32:19,896
She's busy carrying out
Madam Red Dragon's orders.

397
00:32:27,153 --> 00:32:28,988
[sarcastic] Okay. No problem.

398
00:32:39,958 --> 00:32:41,292
-[henchwoman] I'm sorry, ma'am.
-Okay.

399
00:32:41,376 --> 00:32:42,835
Wait! Wait! Sorry.

400
00:32:42,919 --> 00:32:43,711
Sorry.

401
00:32:45,380 --> 00:32:46,464
Yes, Emilia?

402
00:33:00,144 --> 00:33:01,479
Looking for something?

403
00:33:01,896 --> 00:33:03,648
Didn't Mama give you orders?

404
00:33:06,442 --> 00:33:09,904
Also, are you trying to keep us apart?

405
00:33:13,199 --> 00:33:16,285
You know, I'm sure my mama
would want you to fill me in

406
00:33:16,369 --> 00:33:19,622
on her plans too
because I am her daughter.

407
00:33:25,670 --> 00:33:30,049
I don't remember her
mentioning you at all, really.

408
00:33:31,634 --> 00:33:36,889
I guess I'm the one she trusts
to handle her businesses.

409
00:33:37,432 --> 00:33:40,393
But don't worry, Emilia.
Your mother loves you.

410
00:33:40,476 --> 00:33:42,729
I'm sure she will reach out to you soon.

411
00:33:42,812 --> 00:33:44,230
I know.

412
00:33:44,313 --> 00:33:49,527
She loves me because I am her daughter,
and you're not.

413
00:33:49,610 --> 00:33:51,946
Besides, she already called me.

414
00:33:53,740 --> 00:33:55,533
Good. That way,

415
00:33:55,616 --> 00:33:59,412
you won't need to meddle
in the instructions she gave me.

416
00:34:02,331 --> 00:34:03,624
Goodbye, Emilia.

417
00:34:09,422 --> 00:34:10,590
[Emilia] Excuse me.

418
00:34:11,716 --> 00:34:13,259
[tense music playing]

419
00:34:27,398 --> 00:34:28,483
[goon] He's drunk.

420
00:34:28,566 --> 00:34:32,820
Boss, I can't drink anymore.
I'm going now.

421
00:34:33,446 --> 00:34:36,574
-You're such a weakling.
-Don't mind him. Let him go.

422
00:34:36,908 --> 00:34:39,827
-Go home to your wife.
-[Jose] Cheers, cheers.

423
00:34:40,912 --> 00:34:42,288
-Sir.
-Let's drink some more, Boss.

424
00:34:42,747 --> 00:34:44,415
[suspenseful music playing]

425
00:34:49,045 --> 00:34:50,880
[gunshots]

426
00:34:57,428 --> 00:34:58,304
[gunshot]

427
00:35:00,181 --> 00:35:01,099
[gunshot]

428
00:35:09,690 --> 00:35:11,275
[motorcycle engine revving]

429
00:35:11,359 --> 00:35:13,152
[gunshots]

430
00:35:15,738 --> 00:35:17,406
[tense music playing]

431
00:35:34,715 --> 00:35:35,967
<i>New package for you.</i>

432
00:35:42,348 --> 00:35:43,391
-[screams]
-<i>Sorry, ma'am.</i>

433
00:35:43,474 --> 00:35:44,600
<i>You idiot! Watch where you walk!</i>

434
00:35:44,684 --> 00:35:45,601
<i>Sorry, ma'am.</i>

435
00:35:45,685 --> 00:35:48,479
<i>We're very sorry, ma'am.</i>
<i>Please let us clean it for you.</i>

436
00:35:50,523 --> 00:35:52,150
<i>Here's your jacket, ma'am.</i>

437
00:36:14,380 --> 00:36:15,214
Thank you.

438
00:36:17,258 --> 00:36:18,843
Good day, Madam Mercedes.

439
00:36:23,097 --> 00:36:24,640
[tense music playing]

440
00:36:33,900 --> 00:36:35,526
Madam Mercedes.

441
00:36:37,653 --> 00:36:39,155
It has a nice ring to it.

442
00:37:15,024 --> 00:37:17,902
[tense music playing]

443
00:37:23,449 --> 00:37:25,910
He will win, who prepares himself.

444
00:37:27,954 --> 00:37:30,623
Wait to take the enemy unprepared.

445
00:37:43,678 --> 00:37:46,305
[Mercedes] <i>Once you've gathered</i>
<i>all the documents,</i>

446
00:37:46,389 --> 00:37:48,140
<i>you must store them in the vault.</i>

447
00:37:48,224 --> 00:37:51,018
<i>Then, wait for my next instructions.</i>

448
00:37:53,396 --> 00:37:55,022
[tense music playing]

449
00:38:01,696 --> 00:38:05,491
Come on, Mercedes.
Can't you read it a bit louder?

450
00:38:49,744 --> 00:38:51,370
[tense music playing]

451
00:39:25,613 --> 00:39:26,739
Sahara.

452
00:39:28,949 --> 00:39:30,409
Yes, Madam Mercedes?

453
00:39:30,993 --> 00:39:32,495
Prepare the vault.

454
00:39:33,287 --> 00:39:34,288
Yes, Madam.

455
00:39:43,589 --> 00:39:45,257
[ominous music playing]

456
00:39:46,050 --> 00:39:48,761
Aren't you supposed
to help your mother out?

457
00:39:49,720 --> 00:39:53,808
Yeah, but I'm so annoyed by
her daughter-wannabe.

458
00:39:53,891 --> 00:39:55,184
She's so irritating.

459
00:39:55,684 --> 00:39:59,021
And they don't realize
that they'll need me someday.

460
00:39:59,563 --> 00:40:03,526
Especially since so many people
are targeting Mama's business.

461
00:40:04,026 --> 00:40:05,361
Why would she be a target?

462
00:40:05,778 --> 00:40:08,322
What's her business, anyway?
It's all legal, right?

463
00:40:09,698 --> 00:40:10,866
Of course, it is.

464
00:40:11,242 --> 00:40:14,870
And you know, Mama, right?
Can we just not talk about her?

465
00:40:15,121 --> 00:40:18,707
I'm going to sleep
and have my beauty rest.

466
00:40:18,791 --> 00:40:20,042
Good night, my dear husband.

467
00:40:24,839 --> 00:40:27,967
[Raul] <i>I'll uncover your</i>
<i>mother's secrets eventually.</i>

468
00:40:29,385 --> 00:40:30,970
<i>I just hope it's not what I think.</i>

469
00:40:36,142 --> 00:40:37,977
<i>But for now, my son needs me.</i>

470
00:40:42,565 --> 00:40:44,275
Hey, where are you going?

471
00:40:44,984 --> 00:40:46,026
I'm going to see my son.

472
00:40:46,485 --> 00:40:50,364
Wait, which one?
Because I can only think of one

473
00:40:50,448 --> 00:40:54,910
you always like to call
but never answers the phone.

474
00:40:54,994 --> 00:40:56,579
Stop it, Emilia. Diego's in mourning.

475
00:40:56,662 --> 00:40:58,873
So why don't you just send him
flowers or a card

476
00:40:58,956 --> 00:40:59,957
and call it a day?

477
00:41:01,876 --> 00:41:05,171
What a grouch. At least I can sleep now.

478
00:41:08,966 --> 00:41:10,676
[pensive music playing]

479
00:41:12,553 --> 00:41:13,929
[phone ringing]

480
00:41:18,017 --> 00:41:18,934
[line ringing]

481
00:41:19,018 --> 00:41:21,020
[Raul] <i>Son, you need to pick up. Diego.</i>

482
00:41:22,813 --> 00:41:24,482
[phone continues ringing]

483
00:41:31,113 --> 00:41:32,531
<i>Diego, pick up.</i>

484
00:41:33,324 --> 00:41:34,867
[phone continues ringing]

485
00:41:41,457 --> 00:41:44,585
Diego? Diego, where are you?
I want to see you.

486
00:41:47,922 --> 00:41:48,881
Diego?

487
00:41:49,882 --> 00:41:51,884
[tense music playing]

488
00:42:01,810 --> 00:42:03,562
[tense music playing]

489
00:42:38,973 --> 00:42:44,311
[Lily] <i>In every letter and every</i>
<i>detail, I study my enemy.</i>

490
00:42:45,187 --> 00:42:49,858
<i>In turn, their strength</i>
<i>becomes mine as well.</i>

491
00:42:50,901 --> 00:42:53,779
<i>Such is the art of war.</i>

492
00:43:07,293 --> 00:43:08,711
[bottles clanking]

493
00:43:09,503 --> 00:43:10,462
Son.

494
00:43:14,967 --> 00:43:16,093
What's wrong?

495
00:43:17,261 --> 00:43:23,350
Why do you keep refusing my help?

496
00:43:25,603 --> 00:43:28,439
Especially now that you know
about the secret I keep.

497
00:43:32,526 --> 00:43:33,861
I'm looking for Sanggano.

498
00:43:34,903 --> 00:43:36,780
Why? What do you want with Sanggano?

499
00:43:38,616 --> 00:43:39,575
I'm going to kill him.

500
00:43:39,658 --> 00:43:41,327
[tense music playing]

501
00:43:42,620 --> 00:43:43,579
[Raul sighs]

502
00:43:44,663 --> 00:43:45,873
You know what, Diego?

503
00:43:45,956 --> 00:43:47,374
Those kinds of things…

504
00:43:49,960 --> 00:43:51,503
You don't have to do that.

505
00:43:52,630 --> 00:43:54,965
Just let me take care of it. I'll do it.

506
00:43:56,133 --> 00:44:00,346
Because I won't… I don't want
anything bad happening to you.

507
00:44:00,429 --> 00:44:01,221
[Diego] No!

508
00:44:02,139 --> 00:44:04,725
I'll be the one to end Sanggano.

509
00:44:08,103 --> 00:44:08,937
Me!

510
00:44:12,024 --> 00:44:13,734
[tense music playing]

511
00:44:24,036 --> 00:44:24,870
Here, Boss.

512
00:44:24,953 --> 00:44:25,954
[goon 1] Let's drink, Boss.

513
00:44:26,288 --> 00:44:27,915
[goon 2] Boss, let's drink.

514
00:44:29,291 --> 00:44:30,959
[tense music playing]

515
00:44:32,920 --> 00:44:34,213
[goon 1] Looks like
your wound still hurts.

516
00:44:41,970 --> 00:44:44,765
Boss, I'm off to the men's room.

517
00:44:45,015 --> 00:44:46,350
Do whatever you want.

518
00:44:46,850 --> 00:44:47,685
Hi, baby.

519
00:44:48,352 --> 00:44:49,436
Hi, baby.

520
00:44:55,943 --> 00:44:58,237
[goon 1] Boss, I'm impressed.
You're still in the mood

521
00:44:58,320 --> 00:45:02,366
to go drinking even after
what happened with Diego.

522
00:45:02,783 --> 00:45:05,244
He's an amateur.
He couldn't even shoot me right.

523
00:45:05,911 --> 00:45:08,622
[Jose] I'd like to see him
try to shoot me again.

524
00:45:09,957 --> 00:45:10,791
Baby, that hurts.

525
00:45:10,874 --> 00:45:13,210
-It does?
-Can you kiss the pain away?

526
00:45:13,293 --> 00:45:14,837
-I think it got better, baby.
-Does it still hurt?

527
00:45:14,920 --> 00:45:15,879
Here. It hurts here, baby.

528
00:45:15,963 --> 00:45:17,965
-Where does it hurt?
-Baby, it hurts.

529
00:45:18,757 --> 00:45:21,885
Can you kiss the pain away?
Can you kiss me again?

530
00:45:21,969 --> 00:45:23,762
Ouch. This one hurts too.

531
00:45:23,846 --> 00:45:24,972
[goon 1] Boss.

532
00:45:25,055 --> 00:45:26,140
Boss, I'll go have a little fun.

533
00:45:26,223 --> 00:45:28,350
[Jose] Hello, baby! Hi!

534
00:45:28,434 --> 00:45:29,393
Does it still hurt?

535
00:45:29,476 --> 00:45:31,353
Yes. Can you kiss me here too?
It still hurts. Here.

536
00:45:31,437 --> 00:45:32,980
[indistinct chatter]

537
00:45:39,903 --> 00:45:40,737
[grunts]

538
00:45:41,864 --> 00:45:43,240
[indistinct chatter]

539
00:45:44,408 --> 00:45:46,243
-Here?
-[Jose] Ouch.

540
00:45:50,956 --> 00:45:52,666
[tense music playing]

541
00:46:11,560 --> 00:46:12,561
Can you?

542
00:46:14,980 --> 00:46:16,023
Then go ahead.

543
00:46:16,648 --> 00:46:17,900
You don't have the guts!

544
00:46:24,364 --> 00:46:25,365
Shoot me!

545
00:46:29,369 --> 00:46:31,038
[Jose and Diego grunting]

546
00:46:34,041 --> 00:46:35,667
[tense music playing]

547
00:46:41,465 --> 00:46:42,466
[gunshot]

548
00:46:56,939 --> 00:46:58,774
[laughing hysterically]

549
00:47:08,951 --> 00:47:10,869
[continues laughing]

550
00:47:12,913 --> 00:47:14,623
Amateur.

551
00:47:16,667 --> 00:47:17,668
[taunting]

552
00:47:18,335 --> 00:47:20,629
[laughing]

553
00:47:32,724 --> 00:47:35,352
[coughing]

554
00:47:40,065 --> 00:47:41,275
[Jose retching]

555
00:48:48,508 --> 00:48:51,345
[tense music swells]

556
00:48:53,805 --> 00:48:56,433
<i>Red Dragon wants to recruit</i>
<i>Diego Torillo to the group.</i>

557
00:48:56,516 --> 00:48:57,601
[Jepoy] <i>Are you nuts?</i>

558
00:48:57,684 --> 00:49:00,520
<i>Julio Ardiente will have you killed</i>
<i>for killing Sanggano!</i>

559
00:49:00,604 --> 00:49:02,356
<i>-You know that, right?</i>
<i>-I'm not afraid to die.</i>

560
00:49:02,439 --> 00:49:05,859
[Julio] <i>Lily Cruz lied to you,</i>
<i>and so did Diego.</i>

561
00:49:05,942 --> 00:49:08,779
<i>Those two ganged up on you.</i>

562
00:49:08,862 --> 00:49:11,657
<i>While we're corrupting Diego Torillo,</i>

563
00:49:11,740 --> 00:49:14,618
<i>it'll only make it worse for Lily Cruz.</i>

564
00:49:14,701 --> 00:49:16,787
<i>I won't join your group as an underling.</i>

565
00:49:16,870 --> 00:49:18,872
<i>I want to join as Red Dragon's ally.</i>

566
00:49:18,955 --> 00:49:22,042
<i>Red Dragon is Helena Montoya.</i>
<i>But there's something missing.</i>

567
00:49:22,125 --> 00:49:23,293
[Lily] <i>I'll find it.</i>

568
00:49:24,169 --> 00:49:25,712
[in Chinese] <i>Hello, Mercedes.</i>

569
00:49:26,505 --> 00:49:28,924
[theme music playing]
